ely. Though Benin students have confirmed this conclusion and demonstrated some possibilities of verifying and correcting its evidence, a reconstruction of the early Benin history will inevitably contain many hypothetical suggestions and not so many firm conclusions.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 869, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 754})
